{"des":"霜烬平原的怪异调查-烧焦的痕迹互动","script":"s_5_6_4","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]慢着慢着，让我缓缓……今天经历的起起落落实在太多了！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]好啦，现在就剩最后一个传说了，看看是不是真的吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]说实话……我有点害怕……要是这个传说也是假的，那我的怪异研究社就完蛋了……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]所以你为啥要成立这个社团？为什么社团一解散你就这么慌张？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我成立社团的初衷，就是希望能与志同道合的朋友们一起探索世界上发生的奇闻轶事。和大家一起深入探索、研究这些传说，有助于我们了解这个世界，收获珍贵的友谊……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]生活可不止眼前的苟且，还有遥远的星空以及广袤的草原啊！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这种积极探索、阳光向上的精神值非常棒哦！所以怪异研究社目前发展如何？[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]额……目前社团只有我一个人，也没有老师对这个社团感兴趣……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]什么嘛……亏你还那么豪言壮语，结果整个社团就你一个人啊。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这……这我也没办法啊，毕竟我这种爱好目前还比较小众。而且我只是个无权无势、也不认识什么大人物的普通学生，能把社团办起来已经很不容易了。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]如果这次新闻社愿意出手相助，让怪异研究社得以延续，那社团从此就能鸟枪换炮、一飞冲天了！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]……既然你这么有信心，那我们就尽全力帮助你，祝你成功！[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]来看看这个烧焦的痕迹……整个洞穴都有……看来有一大批生物曾经聚集在此！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]“永眠洞窟的燃烧军团”，说的就是有人曾在永眠洞窟中看见了一支全身燃烧着火焰的魔物军团。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]据说它们是火山的旧民，自从霜烬平原陷入冰天雪地之后，便从炽热的地底苏醒，它们立誓要用武力夺回这片故土！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊？火山旧民？地底？这槽点也太多了吧？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不管槽点有多少，这些痕迹已经证明了燃烧军团的存在！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]看看这地上的焦痕……这一定是火焰巨人的足迹！看看墙上的抓痕……搞不好这是熔岩化的角布林亚种的爪痕！再看看——[l]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_21","text":"你看看这里的熔火结晶。"},{"tag":"tag_21","text":"这是熔火元素的痕迹。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]熔火结晶……？这些撒在地上的红色碎片就是熔火结晶吗……？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_22"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这……这说明燃烧军团里也有许多熔火元素！说不定它们和熔火元素就是同一种类的生物！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_23"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不过，从未有人见过其他形态的熔火元素……况且比起什么不知名的燃烧军团，这里的痕迹更像是熔火元素留下的……[l]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_24"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_25","text":"熔火元素是群居魔物。"},{"tag":"tag_25","text":"它们或许是为了避寒才来到这里的。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_25"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]你说的有道理啊，那这么说……这些焦痕应该也是熔火元素造成的。很有可能是有人在洞窟里看见熔火元素聚集，以讹传讹成燃烧军团吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_26"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊啊啊！！别说了！再说怪异研究社就要完蛋了！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_27"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]辛辛苦苦搜集了四个传闻，结果全都是谣言，而且真相还这么朴实无华，一点也没有意思！这是天要亡我怪异研究社啊！！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_28"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这个……你也别太伤心了，这些传闻本来就是大家口口相传的，有些夸大也很正常……[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_29"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]先回去和普雅雅报告吧，说不定事情还有转机呢。[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_30"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]四个传言全被戳破，还有什么转机可言……我现在回去，也不过是去掐灭社团最后的希望罢了。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_31"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]但逃避也不是办法啊，先回大书院本院去找普雅雅报告吧，至少让她看到我们的态度，不是吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_32"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]行吧……回去就回去吧……我的社团，我的社团啊……[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_33"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}